menu "Orb model"

config ORB_MODEL_DEMO
    bool "Run the offline shell preview with synthetic sessions/cards"
    default n
    help
        Explicit developer fixture switch. The application labels this preview
        as Demo and does not start networking or connect to the live hub. Saved
        Wi-Fi and pairing data are preserved. Service actions are disabled.
        Leave this off for normal firmware, including paired devices.

endmenu
